==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|maxes out|maxing out|maxed out|maxed out}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To [[reach]] the [[limit]] of one's [[capability|capabilities]].
# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To reach a [[maximum]] or a point at which no more [[growth]] or [[improvement]] is [[possible]].
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To use (something) to the limit of its capabilities
#: ''I've spent all afternoon shopping and '''maxed out''' my credit card.''

